{"root":{"data":{"id":"dm48mohnevc0","created":1791948221658,"text":"决策树"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48mtjb28w0","created":1791948232642,"text":"基本流程"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48mwlwtd40","created":1791948239330,"text":"目的"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48na9m2xs0","created":1791948269061,"text":"决策树学习的目的是生成一颗泛化性能强的决策树。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48nh10sew0","created":1791948283779,"text":"结束标志"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48nk37hdc0","created":1791948290442,"text":"当前结点样本全部属于同一类别，直接标记为叶结点；"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm48no17s8g0","created":1791948299028,"text":"属性集为空，或者所有样本在剩余属性取值完全相同，无法划分：叶结点标记为该结点样本中数量最多的类别；"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm48ns2fy140","created":1791948307810,"text":"当前结点包含的样本集合为空，不能划分。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48o32z3z40","created":1791948331786,"text":"算法核心"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48o66mn0o0","created":1791948338538,"text":"选择最优划分属性，不断划分提升结点样本的纯度"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48o91u2ls0","created":1791948344778,"text":"划分选择"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48ojtiw0w0","created":1791948368220,"text":"纯度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48on1xmqo0","created":1791948375259,"text":"分支结点所包含的样本尽可能属于同一类别，纯度越高。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48owxtqmg0","created":1791948396779,"text":"信息增益(ID3算法)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48p1dru1s0","created":1791948406450,"text":"信息熵Ent(D)","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48p7ils1s0","created":1791948419803,"text":"度量样本集合纯度最常用的指标"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm48pjpfynk0","created":1791948446338,"text":"公式"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48pn4yh9s0","created":1791948453806,"text":"Ent(D)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm48pz1axeg0","created":1791948479707,"text":"值越小，纯度越高，比如说如果全是一类，值便是0，如果一半正类，一半负类。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48q6z2bgo0","created":1791948496985,"text":"信息增益Gain(D,a)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48qaigiw00","created":1791948504689,"text":"使用属性a划分数据集D带来的纯度提升。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm48qhuo8q00","created":1791948520665,"text":"公式"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48qmcgsq00","created":1791948530448,"text":"Gain(D,a)"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48qtaysxc0","created":1791948545594,"text":"特点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48r4gwlew0","created":1791948569898,"text":"偏好取值数目多的属性，例如样本编号，会生成每个分支只有一个样本，泛化能力极差。ID3选择信息增益最大的属性作为划分属性。"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48rlldmyw0","created":1791948607174,"text":"增益率(C4.5算法)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48ruygfq00","created":1791948627556,"text":"ID3偏好数目多的划分方式，为减少带来的不利影响。不直接使用信息增益，而是使用增益率作为划分标准。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm48s2mm2go0","created":1791948644254,"text":"公式"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48s6jfc3k0","created":1791948652769,"text":"Gain_ratio(D,a)"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48seiyiog0","created":1791948670154,"text":"固有值IV（a）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48stx10540","created":1791948703657,"text":"属性取值越多，IV(a)越大。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48t32ky0o0","created":1791948723584,"text":"基尼指数（CART 算法）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48t76qz540","created":1791948732543,"text":"基尼值Gini(D)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48ta2j2ao0","created":1791948738818,"text":"从数据集随机抽两个样本，类别标记不一致的概率；Gini(D)越小，纯度越高。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48topiyu80","created":1791948770683,"text":"基尼指数Gini_index(D,a)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48ttrqosg0","created":1791948781701,"text":"CART选择基尼指数最小的属性做划分"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48odcmbnk0","created":1791948354137,"text":"剪枝处理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48uddprw00","created":1791948824389,"text":"剪枝是决策树缓解过拟合的核心手段。分为预剪枝、后剪枝，一般使用验证集评估泛化性能，判断是否剪枝。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm48uh0yc940","created":1791948832324,"text":"预剪枝"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48unzc0000","created":1791948847464,"text":"在树生成过程中，划分结点前就评估：如果该划分不能提升验证集精度，则停止划分，直接标记为叶结点。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm48uvei7hk0","created":1791948863619,"text":"优点"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48uk87umw0","created":1791948839294,"text":"后剪枝"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48us63u3k0","created":1791948856580,"text":"先生成一棵完整的未剪枝决策树，自底向上遍历所有非叶结点，尝试把该子树替换为叶结点；若替换后验证集性能不下降，则执行剪枝。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm48uwbm28w0","created":1791948865620,"text":"优点"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48of2nu3s0","created":1791948357889,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}